  "description": "As your gateway into downhill, the TUES CORE 2 is a defining bike within our lineup. The combination of affordable value and epic performance underlines who we are as a brand, helping riders get their gravity kicks at the bike park and make waves within their local scene. Take chances and trust your instincts - the aluminum frame is crafted for maximum strength to survive seasons of lift-laps and nail-biting moments, while the carefully selected built-kit utilizes only the hardest-wearing components. Sure to put a grin on your face, the playful ride character of the TUES 27 injects endless fun into every lap. Perfect for laying down tricks in the park or blowing up turns in your local woods, 27.5” is the wheel size of choice for thrill-seeking gravity connoisseurs.",
